#: plugins/datenums/datenums.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"For each day this plugin shows its daynumber of the year at the top of the "
"agenda view. For example, February 1 is day 32 of the year."
msgstr "Ovaj dodatak prikazuje redni broj dana u godini pri vrhu prikaza dnevnog reda. Primjerice, 1. veljače 32. je dan u godini."

#: plugins/hebrewcalendar/hebrew.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "Shows dates and Jewish holidays in the Hebrew calendar system."
msgstr "Prikazuje datume i židovske blagdane prema hebrejskom kalendarskom sustavu."

#: plugins/lunarphases/lunarphases.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"This plugin shows the day's lunar phase (New, First, Last, Full) at noon "
"according to your system timezone."
msgstr "Ovaj dodatak prikazuje mjesečevu mijenu (mlađak, prva četvrt, zadnja četvrt ili uštap) u podne prema vremenskoj zoni vašeg sustava."

#: plugins/picoftheday/picoftheday.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid "This plugin provides the Wikipedia Picture of the Day"
msgstr "Ovaj dodatak prikazuje Wikipedijinu sliku dana"

#: plugins/thisdayinhistory/thisdayinhistory.json
msgctxt "Description"
